   "textLength": 438,
   "text": "Investopedia was founded in 1999 with the mission of helping people improve their financial outcomes. Our readers come to us from all over the world and from all walks of life. Some are learning about money and investing for the first time, while others are experienced investors, business owners, professionals, financial advisors, and executives looking to improve their knowledge and skills. No ma",
